This is the main codebase context for the Google Drive Clone application. Pull the versions from package.json or package-lock.json and then searchy on the wqeb for the documentation for the version in this app.

Key technologies:
- Next.js 15.1.6 with App Router
- React 19
- TypeScript @v5.6
- TailwindCSS @v3.4
- shadcn@latest using cli
- Drizzle ORM@latest, drizzle Kit@latest with Neon serverless @latest PostgreSQL @latest, pull from package.json, all here are @latest
- Clerk Auth @v6
- UploadThing for file storage @v7


